  "description": "A company wants to recover older object versions after an S3 object is overwritten or deleted. Which feature should it enable?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>문제 풀이</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 041</p><h1>문제 풀이</h1></div><strong>41 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"41번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:38%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q041\" data-question=\"Q041\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q041</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to recover older object versions after an S3 object is overwritten or deleted. Which feature should it enable?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q041\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">NAT</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q041\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q041\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS Multi-Attach</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q041\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 버전 관리는 이전 버전을 보존한다. 비용과 삭제 마커도 고려한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></